        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "Science and Education shall serve as Co-Chairs of the Council. The Council shall include as members the Administrators of the Agricultural Marketing Service, the Agricultural Research Service, the Cooperative State Research Service, the Economic Research Service, the Extension Service, the Food and Nutrition Servic",
