    {
        "id": "dr1044_7-req-013",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "Secretary of State must transmit to Congress the text of any international agreement, other than a treaty, to which the United States is a party as soon as practicable after such agreement has entered into force. The Secretary of State has issued regulations that set forth the criteria to be used by governmental a",
